    <summary>High-Performance Utility Distribution and Grid Analytics Engine in Native C</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[VoltBill is an enterprise-grade utility distribution engine and customer management system written in native ISO C (C99/C11).

Features:
- Multi-tier progressive slab billing
- Solar net metering deduction
- Industrial power factor penalty and rebate adjustment
- Time-of-Day (ToD) tariff configuration
- Dynamic runtime tariff editing
- Authentic ISO/IEC 18004 QR code generation for digital UPI payments
- Modbus RTU/TCP industrial telemetry decoder with CRC-16 polynomial verification
- Automated Under-Frequency Load Shedding (UFLS) grid defense engine
- Zero heap allocation in calculation hot paths (O(1) memory predictability)

Engineered by Akshar Miyani.]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/miyaniakshar1234/VoltBill/releases/tag/v2.1.0</releaseNotes>
